{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"proposal-npm-watchlists-and-weekly-digests","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Proposal: NPM Watchlists and Weekly Digests"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"north-star","children":[{"type":"text","value":"North Star"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Turn TanStack NPM Stats into a durable market map for JavaScript libraries, not just a charting tool."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Users should be able to follow a set of libraries, understand who is actually gaining or losing ground inside that set, and get a concise weekly digest that surfaces meaningful movement without reacting to noisy daily swings."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"why-this-matters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Why This Matters"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Raw npm download charts are useful, but they do not answer \"who is winning?\""}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Raw download growth is increasingly misleading because the whole ecosystem keeps growing."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Users care about cohorts, rankings, trend changes, and share shifts more than isolated download counts."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack already has fast comparison UX and historical npm data. This feature turns that into a repeatable product."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"product-outcome","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Product Outcome"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add rollups and watchlists that users can explore, compare, and subscribe to by email once a week."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Each digest should answer:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Which libraries moved up or down?"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Which libraries gained or lost share?"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Which crossovers happened?"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Which trends look sustained instead of noisy?"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"core-product-principles","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Core Product Principles"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"packages -> entities -> rollups -> watchlists"},{"type":"text","value":" should be the core model."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Watchlists are the user-facing saved and subscribed surface."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rollups are reusable editorial groupings for charts, rankings, and ecosystem views."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Popular comparisons are just one derived view, not the source of truth."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rankings should be cohort-aware, not framed as vague \"global npm rank\"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Normalization should favor share and relative outperformance, not raw download growth."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Long-term rollups must work across legacy package names and package renames."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Weekly summaries should highlight meaningful movement, not short-term volatility."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"user-stories","children":[{"type":"text","value":"User Stories"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As a user, I can subscribe to a curated watchlist like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Data Fetching"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Build Tools"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As a user, I can save a custom watchlist from the current "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/stats/npm"},{"type":"text","value":" comparison."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As a user, I can follow a logical library even if its npm history spans multiple package names."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As a user, I can receive a weekly digest showing rank changes, share changes, and notable crossovers."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As a user, I can look back across months or years and see how the watchlist evolved."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As a user, I can compare larger ecosystem rollups like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStack"},{"type":"text","value":" vs "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Vercel"},{"type":"text","value":" vs "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Remix"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As a user, I can plot entities grouped by rollup on charts."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"product-shape","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Product Shape"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-tracked-entities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Tracked entities"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The atomic unit should not be a single npm package. It should be a logical tracked entity."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  id: 'tanstack-query',\n  label: 'TanStack Query',\n  packages: ['@tanstack/react-query', 'react-query'],\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This gives us:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"continuity across legacy/current package names"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"stable ranking entities"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"cleaner digest language"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"long-term rollups without losing historical identity"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-rollups","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Rollups"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A rollup is a reusable grouped view of tracked entities."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack-ecosystem"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercel-ecosystem"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remix-ecosystem"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data-fetching-ecosystem"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"router-ecosystem"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rollups let us:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"compare larger ecosystems on charts"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"group entities visually inside one watchlist"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"create reusable market-map views without copying entity membership everywhere"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"support ecosystem-vs-ecosystem reporting in digests later"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"3-watchlists","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. Watchlists"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A watchlist is a named saved surface for ranking, digesting, and charting."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A watchlist can contain:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"entities directly"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rollups"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or both, depending on the UX we want"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recommended watchlist types:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Curated category watchlists"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Curated benchmark watchlists"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack-specific watchlists"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ecosystem watchlists"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"User-created custom watchlists"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"4-weekly-digest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. Weekly digest"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Each watchlist can produce a weekly digest with:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"current rank"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"previous rank"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rank delta"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"share of watchlist"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"share delta"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"trailing 4-week trend"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"notable crossovers"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"link back to the live chart"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Future digest expansions:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rollup-vs-rollup share changes"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"entity movement inside a rollup"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ecosystem momentum summaries"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"current-model-draft","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current Model Draft"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is the current preferred abstraction stack:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package"},{"type":"text","value":": raw npm package history"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"entity"},{"type":"text","value":": one logical library or product across one or more packages"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rollup"},{"type":"text","value":": reusable editorial grouping of entities"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"watchlist"},{"type":"text","value":": a saved and subscribable surface for charts, rankings, and digests"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current preferred type direction:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"export type NpmTrackedEntity = {\n  id: string\n  label: string\n  shortLabel?: string\n  description?: string\n  categories: Array<\n    | 'tanstack'\n    | 'data-fetching'\n    | 'routing'\n    | 'state'\n    | 'table'\n    | 'form'\n    | 'virtualization'\n    | 'testing'\n    | 'styling'\n    | 'build'\n    | 'validation'\n    | 'docs'\n    | 'framework'\n    | 'animation'\n    | 'tooling'\n    | 'database'\n  >\n  color?: string\n  packages: Array<{\n    name: string\n    from?: string\n    to?: string\n  }>\n  lineageStrategy?: 'sum-all' | 'time-bounded'\n  benchmarkEligible?: boolean\n  popularComparisonEligible?: boolean\n  hidden?: boolean\n}\n\nexport type NpmRollup = {\n  id: string\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  kind: 'ecosystem' | 'category' | 'benchmark' | 'editorial'\n  entityIds: string[]\n  membershipMode?: 'exclusive' | 'overlap'\n  color?: string\n  public?: boolean\n}\n\nexport type NpmWatchlist = {\n  id: string\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  kind: 'curated-category' | 'curated-benchmark' | 'curated-tanstack'\n  entityIds?: string[]\n  rollupIds?: string[]\n  featured?: boolean\n  public?: boolean\n  popularComparison?: boolean\n  benchmark?: boolean\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Important modeling notes:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"categories belong on entities as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"categories: string[]"},{"type":"text","value":", not a single "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"category"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"watchlists are still the primary curated product surface"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rollups are the reusable grouping abstraction"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"popular comparisons should be derived from the registry, not hand-maintained independently"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"v1 can mostly use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lineageStrategy: 'sum-all'"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the model should still leave room for future time-bounded lineage"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"current-decisions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current Decisions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These are the main decisions made so far and should be preserved in any handoff."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Do not frame the feature as \"global npm rank\" in v1."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rank within a defined cohort, watchlist, or benchmark basket."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use trailing 28-day downloads for ranking."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use share of watchlist as the primary normalization lens."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use relative growth vs watchlist median as a secondary lens."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defer anomaly detection."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prefer conservative digest-oriented trend signals over loose anomaly alerts."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build curated entities and watchlists separately from current "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"popular comparisons"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Include legacy package rollups where lineage is clear."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preserve compatibility with long-term and multi-year rollups."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Treat rollups as first-class because ecosystem-vs-ecosystem views are valuable."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Allow entities to belong to multiple categories."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Allow some rollups to overlap and some to be exclusive."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"lineage-decisions-so-far","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lineage Decisions So Far"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These are the explicit lineage calls already discussed."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Roll up "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"react-query"},{"type":"text","value":" into "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-query"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Roll up "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"react-table"},{"type":"text","value":" into "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-table"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Roll up "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"react-virtual"},{"type":"text","value":" into "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-virtual"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Do not automatically roll "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"react-location"},{"type":"text","value":" into "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-router"},{"type":"text","value":" in v1."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Form may eventually need separate entity treatment for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/form-core"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-form"},{"type":"text","value":", but one product-level entity is acceptable for v1."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"starter-registry-direction","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Starter Registry Direction"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These are the concrete examples already drafted and should be treated as the current starting point, not final production data."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Starter entities:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack-query"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode",